return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'babilim-0.1.0-zh_TW-babilim-0.1.0-zh_TW-20261030T014834','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:50+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:50+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Babilim'=>'Babilim','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'為您網站上已安裝的外掛與佈景主題補上缺少的翻譯。','Translations'=>'翻譯','Babilim Settings'=>'Babilim 設定','Settings'=>'設定','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您沒有權限執行此操作。','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'請減少選取的元件：每次執行最多 %1$d 項操作（您選取了 %2$d 項）。','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此網站未安裝該元件，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','Already installed.'=>'已安裝。','Downloaded and installed.'=>'已下載並安裝。','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'此網站尚未啟用 Babilim。','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'此語言沒有可下載的建置版本。','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'已回滾至上一個建置版本。','Rolled back and reported.'=>'已回滾並回報。','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'已回滾，但無法傳送回報：%s','Removed.'=>'已移除。','Translation requested.'=>'已申請翻譯。','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'此元件已上傳過，Babilim 正在檢查。','Upload cancelled.'=>'已取消上傳。','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'上傳完成，已申請翻譯。','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此元件未宣告版本號碼，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此元件的版本號碼超過 %d 個字元，Babilim 無法處理，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'目前無法在此網站為該語言申請翻譯。','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'謝謝您，已送出您的回報。','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'此回報未指明有效的外掛或佈景主題與語言。','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'請為此回報選擇類別。','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'此回報缺少可供回報的有效建置版本。','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'此網站目前不認得此元件／語言的這個建置版本。','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'欄位「%1$s」過長：目前有 %2$d 個字元，上限為 %3$d 個。尚未傳送任何內容，請縮短後再試一次。','Original string'=>'原始字串','String context'=>'字串語境','Current translation'=>'目前譯文','Suggested translation'=>'建議譯文','Note (optional)'=>'備註（選填）','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'您在哪裡看到的（選填）','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Babilim 同步暫時被服務延後（受到速率限制），將於 %s 後再試。','The locale you added is not valid: use a WordPress locale code such as ll_CC (letters, digits, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'您新增的語言代碼無效：請使用 WordPress 語言代碼，例如 ll_CC（字母、數字、底線、連字號或 @，最多 %d 個字元）。尚未儲存任何內容。','Settings saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'若啟用此選項，解除安裝時也會清除此網站的身分。之後無法自動還原附加在此網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援團隊（%s）才能取回。','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim 設定為在刪除外掛時清除此網站的身分。之後無法自動還原附加在此網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援團隊（%s）。若要保留身分，請按「取消」，在 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此網路上有 %1$d 個網站設定為在刪除外掛時清除其 Babilim 身分。之後無法自動還原附加在這些網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援團隊（%2$s）。若要保留身分，請按「取消」，在各網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'這個網路中的網站數量太多，無法逐一檢查，其中部分網站可能設定為在外掛刪除時清除其 Babilim 身分。此類網站所附的付費授權之後將無法自動還原，您必須透過 %s 聯絡 Babilim 支援團隊。若要保留這些身分，請按「取消」，在每個網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','Open Babilim settings'=>'開啟 Babilim 設定','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，因此不會下載或安裝任何內容。','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'服務無法連線到您的網站。可能是防火牆、安全性外掛或主機規則封鎖了請求；請允許對 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 的請求。','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'您的網站回應時間過長。請稍後再試，並檢查主機是否過慢或負載過高。','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'您的網站有回應，但內容與預期不符。REST API 可能被其他外掛改寫，或該端點遭到快取；請將 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 排除在快取與改寫之外。','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'請確認您的網站可從網際網路存取，然後再試一次。','Re-verify'=>'重新驗證','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'此網站超出服務單次同步可接受的大小，因此部分項目未納入：%1$d 個元件與 %2$d 個語系。','This site is verified.'=>'此網站已驗證。','Registration restarted.'=>'已重新開始註冊。','Sync complete.'=>'同步完成。','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim 正在啟用並檢查此網站… 請重新載入此頁面，或等待排程檢查完成。','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim 無法完成啟用（%1$s）：%2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'一次只處理一個 PHP 請求的主機無法完成此步驟。','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim 已啟用：此網站已驗證，並找到 %d 個元件。','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim 已停用。不會再傳送任何資料；已安裝的翻譯仍可正常運作。','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'已重建補充翻譯索引。','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'掃描完成：已刪除 %d 個檔案。','Removed %d installed component.'=>'已移除 %d 個已安裝的元件。','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'自動安裝現已關閉；若需要，可在設定中重新開啟。','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim 會找出此網站上沒有您語言翻譯的外掛與佈景主題，並為每一個安裝翻譯。','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'在此網站上找到的語言：%s。','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot).'=>'可用的翻譯只要一鍵即可安裝，缺少的翻譯則可提出申請。之後，新翻譯與更新會自動安裝（免費方案僅限已使用免費名額的外掛與佈景主題）。','The free plan covers a limited number of plugins and themes; your exact quota is shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'免費方案涵蓋的外掛與佈景主題數量有限；啟用 Babilim 後，您可在設定中查看確切的配額。','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'啟用 Babilim 時會傳送的資料','Enabling…'=>'啟用中…','Enable Babilim'=>'啟用 Babilim','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'按一下「啟用」，即表示您同意將上述資訊傳送給 Babilim。','Check again now'=>'立即重新檢查','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'自上次造訪以來，Babilim 已自動安裝 %d 個翻譯。','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim 正在啟用並檢查此網站…（上次嘗試：%s）','Check again'=>'重新檢查','No components synced yet.'=>'尚未同步任何元件。','%d succeeded'=>'%d 個成功','%d skipped'=>'%d 個已略過','%d failed'=>'%d 個失敗','%d not yet tried'=>'%d 個尚未嘗試','Bulk %s:'=>'批次%s：','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s無需執行任何動作。','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s。','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s（%2$s）：%3$s','Continuing…'=>'正在繼續…','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'繼續下一批（剩餘 %d 項）','Search components'=>'搜尋元件','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'這些是此網站使用的語言。您可以在 %s 中變更。','Upload this component?'=>'要上傳此元件嗎？','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'沒有等待確認的上傳。','Back'=>'返回','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'若要翻譯此元件，Babilim 需要取得其原始碼。','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'%1$s（版本 %2$s）的整個外掛或佈景主題目錄都會上傳至 Babilim。','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'如果該目錄包含金鑰、記錄檔或客戶資料，這些內容也會一併上傳。服務會移除常見的敏感檔案（設定檔、環境檔、資料庫傾印檔、記錄檔、金鑰），但無法保證能找出所有檔案。','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'上傳的內容會保留，直到您要求 Babilim 刪除為止。','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'內容由服務的代管供應商儲存，並交由 AI 模型處理以產生翻譯。','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'原文及據此產生的翻譯，將提供給其他安裝相同版本的網站。','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'繼續即表示您確認擁有上傳此元件的權利。','Upload and request'=>'上傳並申請','Uploading…'=>'正在上傳…','Cancel'=>'取消','Uploading'=>'正在上傳','There is no upload in progress.'=>'目前沒有進行中的上傳。','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'正在上傳第 %1$d 部分，共 %2$d 部分…','Continue'=>'