bilim 的翻譯。除非取消勾選此項，否則這些檔案會被保留。','Uninstall'=>'解除安裝','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'預設為關閉：刪除外掛時會保留此網站的身分，因此重新安裝後可繼續使用。','Account'=>'帳號','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','Disable Babilim'=>'停用 Babilim','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'已安裝的翻譯會保留，但不會再執行任何檢查或下載。','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'要停用 Babilim 嗎？已安裝的翻譯會保留，但不會再執行任何檢查或下載。','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'此網站尚未在 Babilim 註冊。','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'此網站已取得授權。請重新載入頁面。','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'目前無法為此網站進行結帳。','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'無法開始結帳：%s','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim 尚未啟用。','Not registered yet'=>'尚未註冊','Not verified'=>'未驗證','Verified'=>'已驗證','Status'=>'狀態','Licensed'=>'已授權','Partner'=>'合作夥伴','Free'=>'免費','License'=>'授權','Upgrade this site'=>'升級此網站','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'此網站一次性購買:%1$s %2$s。包含所有未來的翻譯更新。付款將由 Paddle 在新分頁中處理。','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'這會核發新的還原碼,舊的還原碼將失效。要繼續嗎?','Show a new restore code'=>'顯示新的還原碼','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore code'=>'還原碼','Restore purchase'=>'還原購買','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'之前曾為此網域購買授權?請輸入您在結帳時收到的還原碼。','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'這看起來不像還原碼。','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'此網站無法識別這組還原碼。','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'嘗試次數過多,請明天再試。','This site must be verified first.'=>'必須先驗證此網站。','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'無法還原購買:%s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'購買已還原,此網站現已取得授權。','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'此網站沒有可顯示還原碼的購買紀錄。','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'無法顯示新的還原碼:%s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'您的新還原碼:%s。請妥善保存,舊的還原碼已失效。','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Babilim 檢查此網站時會傳送的資料','(detected)'=>'(已偵測)','No language is managed yet.'=>'尚未管理任何語言。','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim 會為此處勾選的每種語言新增翻譯。','Add another language'=>'新增其他語言','Choose a language…'=>'選擇語言…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'無法從服務載入完整的 WordPress.org 語系清單,因此目前無法新增其他語言。','Theme'=>'佈景主題','Plugin'=>'外掛','Free quota'=>'免費配額','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'下載次數:%1$d/%2$d(%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'補充翻譯索引','Built'=>'已建置','Included'=>'已納入','Excluded'=>'已排除','Already in WordPress core'=>'已在 WordPress 核心中','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'補充翻譯維護','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'目前無法取得維護狀態。','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'清理作業已於 %1$s 暫停:%2$s。未刪除任何內容。','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'上次清理時間：%1$s，新標記 %2$d 個，已刪除 %3$d 個檔案，已移除 %4$d 筆記錄。','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'尚未執行任何清理。','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'在 %1$s 對 translation-index（%2$s）的寫入與另一個請求發生衝突，未被套用；已保留最新版本。','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'在 %1$s 對 translation-index（%2$s）的寫入無法完成，未被套用（%3$s）。','Maintenance'=>'維護','Rebuild index now'=>'立即重建索引','Sweep now'=>'立即清理','Danger zone'=>'危險區域','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'移除 Babilim 為此網站上所有外掛與佈景主題安裝的每個語言檔案。','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'確定要移除 Babilim 安裝的所有內容嗎？這會刪除 Babilim 為此網站上所有外掛與佈景主題安裝的每個語言檔案。','Remove