r a different version, free quota used'=>'已安裝 · 為其他版本建置，免費配額已用完','translation statusAvailable'=>'可用','Installed · %s'=>'已安裝 · %s','Available · %s'=>'可用 · %s','Update'=>'更新','Download'=>'下載','Updating…'=>'更新中…','Downloading…'=>'下載中…','Retry request'=>'重試申請','Request newer translation'=>'申請較新的翻譯','Request translation'=>'申請翻譯','Requesting…'=>'申請中…','Requesting a translation uses one of your free slots, unless this component already uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back.'=>'申請翻譯會使用一個可用免費名額，除非此元件已佔用一個名額。翻譯失敗時不會歸還名額。','If this component does not use one of your free slots yet, requesting a translation uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back. Continue?'=>'如果此元件尚未佔用任何可用免費名額，申請翻譯將使用一個名額。翻譯失敗時不會歸還名額。要繼續嗎？','No plugins or themes found.'=>'找不到外掛或佈景主題。','Clear filters'=>'清除篩選條件','No components match these filters. %s'=>'沒有符合這些篩選條件的元件。%s','Select all'=>'全選','All'=>'全部','Available'=>'可用','Updates'=>'更新','Requestable'=>'可申請','Installed'=>'已安裝','Plugins'=>'外掛','Themes'=>'佈景主題','All languages'=>'所有語言','%d to install'=>'%d 個待安裝','Language:'=>'語言：','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'批次操作會套用到每個所選元件的所有相符語言。','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'批次操作只會套用到每個所選元件的所選語言。','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Theme · %s'=>'佈景主題 · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'外掛 · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'要從此網站移除 %2$s 的 %1$s 翻譯嗎？','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'要將 %2$s 的 %1$s 翻譯回滾到上一個建置版本嗎？','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s：%2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s：%2$s（%3$s）','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'註冊驗證挑戰的格式不符預期。','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'這不是有效的建置版本識別碼。','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'拒絕寫入 Babilim 語言檔目錄以外的位置。','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'無法將下載的套件寫入磁碟。','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'非預期的 HTTP %d 回應。','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'本網站的網址，讓服務能驗證您擁有這個網站。','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'您的 WordPress 版本，用於提供相容的翻譯檔案。','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'您的 PHP 版本，用於確認相容性。','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'本外掛自身的版本，讓服務在版本過舊而無法通訊時，能通知您更新。','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'本網站設定的語系。','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'本網站使用的所有語系（網站語系、已安裝的語言包、使用者語系，以及您手動新增的語系）。各語系一視同仁，不會有差別對待。','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'（為本網站產生的公開金鑰）','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'本網站安裝時產生的公開金鑰，用於證明請求確實來自本網站。只會傳送公開的那一半。','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'每個已安裝的外掛／佈景主題：其 slug、版本、text domain、是否為 wp.org 上架項目、內建的語系，以及您已安裝 Babilim 翻譯的語系。','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'僅當您確認上傳非 WordPress.org 上的外掛或佈景主題時：該元件的整個目錄，以 zip 壓縮檔形式傳送。','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'（僅含通用代碼與座標）','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'最多 20 筆待處理的診斷事件（例如某個檔案未通過完整性檢查），每筆僅包含代碼、元件與語系，絕不包含任何字串內容或翻譯文字。','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'不安全的語系：%s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'資訊清單無法使用：%s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'無法判斷啟用中的元件；現有的合併索引維持不變。','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'無法判斷已安裝的外掛／佈景主題；已略過掃除，未刪除任何內容。','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'掃除已中止，未使任何項目成為孤立：%s。','The cleanup ran, but some of