'files\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「files」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「extra_domains」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「build_no」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json 的「server_build_id」不是有效的建置版本 ID。','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json 的「contract」不是有效的版本字串。','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「status」必須為「published」。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「default_domain_entries」無效。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「default_domain_files」無效。','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest 缺少「%s」，或該欄位無效。','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest 的「server_build_id」不是有效的建置版本 ID。','No record for %s'=>'找不到 %s 的紀錄','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'一個或多個提供中的檔案已不符合資訊清單。','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'沒有可回滾的先前建置版本。','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'無法將此變更記錄到翻譯索引中，請再試一次。','Unknown kind: %s'=>'未知的類型：%s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'不安全的文字領域：%s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'文字領域「%1$s」（%2$s）已提供給另一個已安裝的元件（%3$s），因此未安裝任何內容。','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'回滾將會覆寫「%1$s」（%2$s），該檔案目前已提供給另一個已安裝的元件（%3$s），因此未變更任何內容。','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'ZIP 檔缺少預期的檔案：%s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 sha256 不符','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'此套件未宣告主要翻譯檔案。','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'ZIP 檔缺少預期的預設檔案：%s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s 的 sha256 不符','Could not stage %s'=>'無法暫存 %s','Could not stage default/%s'=>'無法暫存 default/%s','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的項目數量不符','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'無法驗證 %s 的項目數量','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 l10n.php 項目數量不符','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'預設補充檔的項目數量不符。','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'此套件未產生可提供使用的主要翻譯檔案。','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'無法為回滾準備 %s。','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'取代 %s 之前無法備份。','Could not move %s into place.'=>'無法將 %s 移動到定位。','English (United States)'=>'英文（美國）','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest 無法使用：%s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法讀取 _manifest.json：%s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法解析 _manifest.json：%s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json 的結構不符預期','Could not create the package archive.'=>'無法建立封裝壓縮檔。','No writable temporary directory is available for packaging.'=>'沒有可供封裝使用的可寫入暫存目錄。','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'元件中有檔案無法讀取，因此未進行封裝。','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'僅能封裝外掛與佈景主題。','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'找不到該元件的主檔案。','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'該元件不在外掛或佈景主題目錄內。','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim 在此步驟逾時，將於下次檢查時繼續。','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，在驗證成功之前不會下載或安裝任何內容。','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'註冊回應缺少必要欄位。','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'沒有待驗證的挑戰。','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'驗證回應缺少 site_token。','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'沒有已記錄的網站 ID，無法輪替權杖。','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'輪換權杖的回應缺少 site_token。','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce 必須是十六進位字串。','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'此 nonce 沒有待處理的挑戰。','Too many requests.'=>'請求次數過多。','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'此網站在 %2$d 種語言下共有 %1$d 個元件，需要 %3$d 個檢查批次；Babilim 每次執行最多只能處理 %4$d 個。請在「設定」中減少管理的語言，或停用未使用的外掛與佈景主題，然後立即再按一次「檢查」。','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim 無法完成此網站的檢查。','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'此網站的網址過長，Babilim 無法註冊。','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'此網站的語系代碼不是 Babilim 可註冊的代碼。','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'下載回應缺少可用的位置。','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'服務提供的上傳資訊不完整。','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'此元件超過服務可接受的大小，因此無法上傳。','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'無法讀取已封裝的元件。','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'上傳的某個部分持續失敗，因此已取消上傳。','Could not read: %s'=>'無法讀取：%s']];